<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1738418156"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:55.764"><div begin="13.874" end="38.778" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.874" end="19.979" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.874" end="15.253">生而为</span><span begin="15.253" end="16.222">人</span> <span begin="16.783" end="17.681">禁得起几</span><span begin="17.681" end="18.493">次</span><span begin="18.493" end="18.753">毁</span><span begin="18.753" end="19.979">坏</span></p><p begin="20.782" end="26.683" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.782" end="22.214">修整太</span><span begin="22.214" end="23.250">难</span> <span begin="23.705" end="24.629">才學会就</span><span begin="24.629" end="25.457">地</span><span begin="25.457" end="25.852">耍</span><span begin="25.852" end="26.683">赖</span></p><p begin="27.811" end="33.935" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.811" end="29.187">你原是</span><span begin="29.187" end="30.203">我</span> <span begin="30.718" end="31.604">凝视许久</span><span begin="31.604" end="32.436">的</span><span begin="32.436" end="32.710">阴</span><span begin="32.710" end="33.935">暗</span></p><p begin="34.366" end="38.778" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.366" end="35.134">却相互</span><span begin="35.134" end="37.945">依</span><span begin="37.945" end="38.778">赖</span></p></div><div begin="41.659" end="1:11.394" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="41.659" end="47.824" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.659" end="42.993">有什么</span><span begin="42.993" end="43.867">差</span><span begin="43.867" end="44.939">别</span> <span begin="45.272" end="45.989">恨</span><span begin="45.989" end="46.361">或</span><span begin="46.361" end="46.608">是</span><span begin="46.608" end="47.824">爱</span></p><p begin="48.633" end="54.659" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.633" end="51.329">都有不愿承认</span><span begin="51.329" end="51.759">的</span><span begin="51.759" end="52.037">孤</span><span begin="52.037" end="54.659">单</span></p><p begin="55.447" end